sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Borrower
    participant Client as Next.js Debts UI
    participant Server as Next.js Server Action
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Transaction

    Borrower->>Client: Pay Monthly Installment ($100)
    Client->>Server: processRepayment(loanId, scheduleId)
    Server->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Server->>DB: SELECT * FROM Wallet WHERE userId = borrowerId FOR UPDATE
    Server->>DB: Verify availableBalance >= $100
    Server->>DB: UPDATE Wallet SET availableBalance -= 100 WHERE userId = borrowerId
    Server->>DB: SELECT * FROM Investment WHERE loanId = loanId
    loop For Each Investor Investment Record
        Server->>Server: Compute payout = installment * ownershipRatio
        Server->>DB: UPDATE Wallet SET availableBalance += payout WHERE userId = investorId
        Server->>DB: INSERT INTO Transaction (type = 'PAYOUT', amount = payout)
    end
    Server->>DB: UPDATE RepaymentSchedule SET status = 'PAID' WHERE id = scheduleId
    Server->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB-->>Server: Transaction Committed
    Server-->>Client: Payment Confirmation